  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Aid Transparency Initiative, Membership Fee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Aid Transparency Initiative (IATI) maintains the Open Datastandard, designed to serve as the common, digital reporting-standard for all participants in the International Development Cooperation.  Enhancing the Transparency of development cooperation, publishing current and forwardlooking data, was identified as a prerequisite for Aid Effectiveness at the High Level Forum in Busan.</narrative>
  </description>
